        "en": "bu is for the thing right here. Serkan stands at the boiler and asks “Bu ne?” (What's this?); the answer is “Bu kombi.” For more than one thing: bunlar, and -lar/-ler on the noun, by vowel harmony: “Bunlar ne? Bardaklar!” A yes/no question takes mı/mi/mu/mü: “Çay istiyor musun?”, “Su sıcak mı? Hayır… soğuk.”",
